{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your nerves. How many combs can you cut before you smash your keyboard against the wall and your monitor against your head? WARNING \u2013 Pain ahead!<br><br>You\u2019re not just riding the hive. You\u2019re here to cut it, steal it, and escape. You\u2019re the Comb Rider \u2014 the deadliest comb raider alive.<br><br>Cut the combs. Collect the honey. Sell the honey. Buy weapons. To cut more combs. And get more honey. You can even buy a tail. Or ears. With your hard-earned honey-money. But your true purpose is clear \u2014 cut the combs and get the honey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927140/extras/483abe80c22b3cf6e4ceb3e72e338045.poster.avif?t=1754954944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927140/extras/483abe80c22b3cf6e4ceb3e72e338045.webm?t=1754954944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter the bees. The ultra-bees. The electro-bees. The <strong>Toothy Death Worms</strong> . The Pink Tentacles of Pain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927140/extras/b1f7c78d08bc098ffb5258b7453437a8.poster.avif?t=1754954944\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927140/extras/b1f7c78d08bc098ffb5258b7453437a8.webm?t=1754954944\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling TVs. Irons. Other stuff. That won't stop you. Or maybe it will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you'll try again. And again. To get the honey. The sweet, sweet honey.</p>","background":"